fastrpc (1.0.6-2) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Add patch dsprpcd-fix-restart-behavior; more resilient behavior in the
    face of daemon crashes, such as the ones currently experienced on Agatti
    platforms (e.g. RB1 or UNOQ). From upstream GH #370.

